// Which of the game's adult heads and bodies are for adults, and which for elders.
//
// A head's or body's name is shown under the panel in Create a Sim, for example "c005ma_kaj" or
// "b800fafit_eldenmama", and a head's under the heads in the head picker. Capitals do not matter. One
// name covers every skin colour.
//
// Heads:   "elder"  only for elders: taken out of Adult, and not given to a child who grows up.
//          "both"   for adults and elders: helmets, bald heads and others that suit either.
//          Any other head is for adults only.
//
// Bodies:  "elder"  only for elders: taken out of Adult, and not given to a child who grows up.
//          "adult"  only for adults: not offered to elders.
//          Any other body is for adults and elders.
//
// Children's heads and bodies:
//          "child"  only for children: not offered for teens.
//
// If this leaves an elder of some sex no heads (or bodies), they are offered every adult one.
// Edit this file in the pack's folder, then restart Simitone.
